      "id": "umdk0a3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. DIRECT TAXES IN DETAIL"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Income Tax:<br/>• Levied on individual income.<br/>• Progressive tax system.<br/><br/>Corporate Tax:<br/>• Levied on company profits.<br/><br/>Capital Gains Tax:<br/>• Levied on gains from sale of assets.",
      "id": "u8zj7yx"
    },
    {
      "id": "wtwezy0",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
