            "<p>Tax on sale of assets</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4njtxs8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. INDIRECT TAXES IN DETAIL"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "GST:<br/>• Implemented on 1 July 2017.<br/>• Destination-based tax.<br/>• Replaced VAT, Service Tax and many others.<br/><br/>Customs Duty:<br/>• Levied on imports and exports.<br/><br/>Excise Duty:<br/>• Levied on manufacture (petroleum, alcohol excluded from GST).",
      "id": "r13om8p"
    },
    {
