    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Voting Pattern:",
      "id": "3out0lk"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "GST Council voting structure: Centre gets 1/3 weight, States get 2/3 weight, requiring 3/4th weighted majority for decisions under Article 279A.",
        "GST was implemented on 1 July 2017 as a destination-based indirect tax.",
        "CBDT handles Direct Taxes, while CBIC handles Indirect Taxes.",
        "The New Tax Regime is now the default option in India's latest income tax structure."
      ],
      "id": "e0z7szm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• Centre’s vote weight = 1/3<br/>• States’ combined vote weight = 2/3<br/>• Decision requires 3/4th majority of weighted votes<br/>",
      "id": "2fr8aot"
    },
    {
      "id": "3oh8271",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. TAX BUOYANCY & TAX-TO-GDP RATIO"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Tax-to-GDP Ratio = (Total Tax Revenue / GDP) × 100<br/>It measures the efficiency of tax collection relative to economic size.",
      "id": "fdt6lm9"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Tax Buoyancy measures responsiveness of tax revenue to changes in GDP.<br/>Formula: % Change in Tax Revenue / % Change in GDP<br/>",
      "id": "cod3bci"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If Tax Buoyancy &gt; 1 → Tax revenue grows faster than GDP.<br/>If Tax Buoyancy &lt; 1 → Tax revenue grows slower than GDP.<br/>",
      "id": "8sat5hd"
    },
    {
      "id": "3ak1zks",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "RRB HIGH-VALUE POINTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• New tax regime is default.<br/>• GST Council formed under Article 279A.<br/>• Centre has 1/3 voting power.<br/>• Tax-to-GDP ratio shows fiscal capacity.",
      "id": "0n02ghr"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "• GST is destination-based tax.<br/>• Direct tax burden cannot be shifted.<br/>• Progressive tax promotes equity.<br/>• GST implemented on 1 July 2017.<br/>",
      "id": "wrvy2jy"
    }
